<title>USA: Waxahachie, Texas $4.500 mln won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Waxahachie, Texas $4.500 mln won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter said it won $4.500 million of Waxahachie, Texas, general obligation limited tax bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.08 percent.</p>
</text>
